{"time": 1766313691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408650323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2124672587]\"我...\"她睁开了眼睛，放下手看向你，眉头蹙在一起，脸上淡淡的妆容被泪水濡湿，显得有些凌乱，\"虽然是我咎由自取...但是...果然还是希望...能说一声再见...\""}
{"time": 1766315291, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682456817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=909515621]“去问问吧，就说是插班生”"}
{"time": 1766322651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639588021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=682456817]\"问谁?\"她有些呆呆地指着自己的太阳穴"}
{"time": 1766339704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105495647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=639588021]“舍管什么的吧，应该能通融通融？我校服都穿上了”"}
{"time": 1766339868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220022516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 还活着吗）"}
