{"time": 1766370274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "858754243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=200375709]“不过，算是确认了，果然时间有点问题。”看着几乎说得上是通明的路面，不把内心的不安表露出来“为什么呢？”"}
{"time": 1766371054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650638134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=858754243]\"嗯哼?\"妃花没有多说什么，大概是怕扰乱你的思绪。"}
{"time": 1766371286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142883852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“等再见到卡珊德拉的时候一定要问清楚才是……不过她之前说，这里有个掌管真实的老家伙？”摇摇头“太晚了，明天再说吧”"}
{"time": 1766371925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515059374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=142883852]\"嗯...\"妃花点点头，\"我也听说过，不过与其说那是真实...不如说，是偏执，无思考，依托于自身的本能吧....\""}
{"time": 1766372419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063299240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“偏执？”总感觉很难和真实连接在一起“听起来是什么……脱离人性的东西。不过可能……倒也算符合？但是卡森德拉看起来完全不像”"}
{"time": 1766372506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1243503547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1063299240]\"她是继承者中唯一的背叛者啦。\"妃花扭头看了看四周，\"呼...现在我也是了。\"说完似乎轻轻笑了笑"}
{"time": 1766372807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1951818302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“遵从本意有什么不好？”扭过头看着她“报恩什么的也，总该有个限度”"}
{"time": 1766373079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477329070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...虽然我现在还是很感谢玛文大人就是了，不过...\"在你身后的话语过了一会才轻轻传到你的耳边，\"应该已经...够了吧?毕竟已经，很久...很久了。\""}
{"time": 1766374073, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203304513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1741873790][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “有位前辈告诉了我所有节点的位置...”"}
{"time": 1766374211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1350689473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1477329070]“……”原本想说，不需要的拯救说不定反而是一种囚禁，但终究没说出口，只是嗯了一声。看看离宿舍还有多远"}
{"time": 1766374222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "156185661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1203304513]\"哦?\"人偶并未开口，你听到清丽的女声，\"这种话妾身可不能当做没听见。\"身着华服的女子从门外走入，\"具体说一说，小家伙。\""}
{"time": 1766374399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474210663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看见龙芙有点惊讶，不过还是老实的说了出来“艾尔前辈告诉我的”拿出之前的地图“节点在这些地方...”把节点的位置指出来"}
{"time": 1766374558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1757983721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1350689473]宿舍离食堂倒不是很远，踩过这段鹅卵石小路，崭新亮堂，橘黄色明漆打底，装饰着在暗夜中也能发出荧光的带妆条纹，目前大多数房间都亮着灯。"}
{"time": 1766374628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834190128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=474210663]那你过个灵感"}
{"time": 1766374637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742002480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1"}
{"time": 1766374637, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1742002480", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]演奏出: 1D20+1={8}+1=9"}
{"time": 1766374881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120455268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "记得并不是很完整，标点有一些凌乱，至少龙芙一直皱着的眉告诉了你这一点"}
{"time": 1766375046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593343815", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉....”"}
{"time": 1766375066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532990314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "绞尽脑汁再去想想当时的地图"}
{"time": 1766375092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640607130", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们进去吧？找找宿管房间”在妃花面前挥挥手，召下魂"}
{"time": 1766375348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808797196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=532990314]回想起来，似乎是魔法绘制的地图?想到这一步也就完蛋了，地图画了什么这件事印象越来越浅"}
{"time": 1766375384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474720785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些懊恼的摇了摇头"}
{"time": 1766375603, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361802332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=640607130]\"哦——\"她这才从自己的想法里脱出，推着你进了其中一间宿舍楼，室内的摆设和教学楼有些相似，以简明的落地玻璃窗为主，走廊干净整洁，宿管的房间就在入口"}
{"time": 1766375899, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995867256", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1474720785]龙芙又等了一会，才悠悠开口，\"小家伙?\"停了下来等你接话"}
{"time": 1766375914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277510658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉...只能记得这么多了”"}
{"time": 1766375935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975318722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“感觉印象似乎越来越淡了”"}
{"time": 1766375989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1184420899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "尝试使用下无色戒指，看能不能和艾尔前辈联系上"}
{"time": 1766376310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025235227", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1184420899]当然没有回应，说到底，这些本身都是元素戒指"}
{"time": 1766376630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903576844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1361802332]自己推动轮子过去敲敲门"}
{"time": 1766376725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465576730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过了一会门内才应声，\"来了。\"随后门被打开，一个保养得还不错的中年女性出现在门后，她低头看着你，\"同学?这么晚了有什么事吗？\""}
{"time": 1766376943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "174055018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那个……您好，我是新入学的，算……插班生？因为腿脚的毛病耽误了入学”低头拍了拍自己的腿“也还没分到宿舍。请问能帮我们安排一间空的宿舍吗？”"}
{"time": 1766376949, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769900007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来妃花穿的什么）"}
{"time": 1766376974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "821969203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(校服)"}
{"time": 1766377086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438899530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=174055018]\"这边确实是一年级的宿舍...看一下你的证件，这边这位同学呢？\"她的目光看向妃花，后者似乎还在发呆"}
{"time": 1766377205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454447263", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，证件）"}
{"time": 1766377585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "919293425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1438899530]“她和我是一起的”装作翻找的样子，一边解释着“去哪了……”"}
{"time": 1766377656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "292309704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"丢在家里?你们总不会都没有证件吧？\"她的眼神有些狐疑，\"现在去补办还来得及。\""}
{"time": 1766378243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1483042893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那个……现在已经好晚了，能不能麻烦通融一下？”厚着脸皮开口“我们这样跑一趟有点麻烦，明天白天一定去，只要能先过个夜就好”"}
{"time": 1766378505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589678494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她皱了皱眉，最后打量了一遍你们两，\"放你们进宿舍是不可能了，不过...只是过夜的话，你们就留在我这里吧。\"她稍微让开门口，露出自己的房间，虽然只有单人床，但是沙发倒是勉强能躺下两个人的样子，也不知道沙发平常是用来做什么的。"}
{"time": 1766378849, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590566827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "虽然有些勉强，不过至少也算能过夜，不住地点头“谢谢，谢谢。我们会保持安静的”"}
{"time": 1766379368, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197507494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我去给你们找两床被子，入秋之后晚上还是有些冷的。\"说完她出了房门，随后很快就离开了宿舍楼。"}
{"time": 1766379930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1266168612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“结果还是要学生证啊……”往沙发那边靠了靠“妃花？刚刚在想什么？”"}
{"time": 1766380359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307062630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"她转头看向你，把你从轮椅上扶起来，一起坐在沙发上，语气算得上有些正经，\"在想，会也会也遇到我认识的人。\""}
{"time": 1766380491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498657718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1766389214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864410952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(醒了)"}
{"time": 1766389506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2005621559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1307062630]（查询错字）"}
{"time": 1766390003, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810766575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我猜在和折神侃大山）"}
{"time": 1766393273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681202368", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(会不会)"}
{"time": 1766393373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402205012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=825734198]"}
{"time": 1766393405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118948497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1766393448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1231992576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(错字啊)"}
{"time": 1766393468, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471579739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1766393540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389838812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“妃花指的是哪类？想见到的还是不想再见的？”想了想“诶——该不会能见到你自己？”"}
{"time": 1766394110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051771485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1389838812]\"说什么啦。\"她笑着敲了敲你的脑袋，\"当然是，我曾经认识的人，见到自己这种事...是不是太惊悚了？\"她的表情收敛起来，\"而且...我没有入过学...\""}
{"time": 1766394235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109455812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔……但是听起来你认识的人里，有入过的？”靠在沙发上，感觉多少有些困倦“是怎样的人？”"}
{"time": 1766394755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305951553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥卡在哪了)"}
{"time": 1766394794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "506497129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2025235227]（）"}
{"time": 1766394804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647851323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1766394813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698098450", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2109455812]\"嗯...\"她解下自己校服的外套，披在你身上，\"伊芙累了的话，现在就睡吧...我的话题可是会很长很长的...\""}
{"time": 1766394836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661251900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“虽然具体的记不清了，不过大概就在这些地方附近了..”"}
{"time": 1766394946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1143393079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就当……听睡前故事了？”虽然这么说，不过老老实实闭上眼睛“有点想听”"}
{"time": 1766395053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1814788393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且，感觉应该也不用破坏所有点位吧，只要破坏大部分的，感觉她的蜘蛛网就会坍塌了”"}
{"time": 1766395636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676722210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1814788393]\"说得也是，我会让人去侦查一番。\"龙芙抽了一口手里的烟斗，迷人的幽香顿时弥漫在房间里，\"你呢?小家伙。\""}
{"time": 1766395729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275845990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1143393079]\"对于我而言都是过分久远的事诶...\"她的语气很轻，\"村子里都会有那种人吧...大家眼中的天才\""}
{"time": 1766395894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498760504", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也想去看看...想早点结束这边的事情...”"}
{"time": 1766396083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375371829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯哼？”回应一样也很轻"}
{"time": 1766396440, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1802987165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1498760504]\"嗯，那就让诺亚和你一起去吧。\"你察觉到她对人偶的称呼，\"嗯...最近的节点...在法师塔呢\""}
{"time": 1766396676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288119542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "她看了看地图，指了指你标出的一个节点，\"虽然不确定是不是准确标，不过...可以去看看。\""}
{"time": 1766396962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1953026439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...可以麻烦让68号照顾一下西莉丝姐姐吗，我害怕...”"}
{"time": 1766397218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360106327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实）"}
{"time": 1766397235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "938383018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诺亚和你去，就代表龙芙不去对不对）"}
{"time": 1766397347, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196849071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=375371829]\"立志要做出一番事业啦...\"她继续开口，\"家里用了所有积蓄，嗯...最后也没有回来，啊，细节就不说了嘛\""}
{"time": 1766397403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "624329448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（男儿立志出乡关？）"}
{"time": 1766397637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014647580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1953026439]\"这个倒是没什么问题...\"她点头，\"之后的事情交给你咯?\""}
{"time": 1766397674, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079482727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后翔哥就要一个人去？）"}
{"time": 1766397747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1229133097", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(诺亚啊)"}
{"time": 1766397800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282190154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，诺亚是几号来着）"}
{"time": 1766397929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522426174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯嗯...”开心的点了点头“我会努力的”"}
{"time": 1766398034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691800400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(34)"}
{"time": 1766398138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1320222404", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=196849071]\"所以...\"她看着你困倦的样子，\"睡吧?\""}
{"time": 1766398378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312004740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么就所以了）"}
{"time": 1766398478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550255696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你又不说话，我怎么知道你在干嘛，所以就所以了)"}
{"time": 1766398532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696178454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那诺亚，等下我”快速的把手上的晚饭吃完，擦擦嘴“我们出发吧”"}
{"time": 1766398560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "377900397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是等她接着说？）"}
{"time": 1766398574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2108353238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=196849071]（这话也接不了啊）"}
{"time": 1766399312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373493923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=196849071]\"嗯...\"她看着你有些困了的样子，\"还要接着说嘛?唔...其实...后面的事情很乏善可陈啦。\""}
{"time": 1766399373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1991314550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”含糊不清地应一声“好奇……”"}
{"time": 1766399397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1790945747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=696178454]她点点头，\"行...\"转过身，\"我们走吧，我带路就好。\""}
{"time": 1766399846, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934123091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1991314550]\"嗯...也不知道什么理由嘛，后面再也没回村子，也没有音讯...叔叔阿姨老得好快...\"她停住话头，\"当时我就在想...魔法学院真是吃人不吐骨头的地方...那么大个人，转眼就不见了...\""}
{"time": 1766400516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330485771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……他叫什么？说不定我听过……”"}
{"time": 1766400841, "type": "recv", "message_id": "134681203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=330485771]\"啊，我想想...\"她露出思索的神情，\"嗯...伊恩?\""}
{"time": 1766400860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125870264", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又在编排我翔哥）"}
{"time": 1766401100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739339750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没听说过……不过，说不定……”点头打瞌睡“哈啊……晚安”"}
{"time": 1766401218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1768557055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我Mr.翔呢)"}
{"time": 1766401226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "906846593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(买小吃买不见了)"}
{"time": 1766401238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724924939", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1766401330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434829205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1739339750]\"晚安。\"她轻轻点头，\"明天见。\"没有再说多余的话，她在你耳边吹了口气，馥郁的香气溢散，你几乎是瞬息之间就入了梦。"}
{"time": 1766401583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664046325", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(过个体质吧，做不做梦是个门道"}
{"time": 1766401615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414709115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（卧槽，我体质多少）"}
