{"time": 1766428352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554659902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“呃……”咬紧牙关，重新闭紧双眼，尽力忍过去"}
{"time": 1766428613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889864484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(欣赏一下终章剧情)"}
{"time": 1766428673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248647039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1554659902]并没有什么显著的作用，疼痛已经是最小的感触，更多的...是一种扎根在心里的抵触感，就像被外物刺激，上千根针扎在表皮一般。"}
{"time": 1766431342, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942726772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=F9118F2558508C973AA6772311EFE379.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRbOJBmP0BuCKDFeyja7Q2MW4ZeIBivhAcg_woo2oz9xPXRkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ38dRgINyD762SHtETNbUpXoCESCCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMLh7kkRmHHSgWBCzD-E76wzcivbwM0LUL9lXuWLzGWnDzsTPne0DLCInDi862VbdZg,file_size=115247]"}
{"time": 1766450204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1977653027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=248647039]“咕呜……”双腿用力绞在一起，非但没能缓解，好像还抽筋了。嘴巴开合但说什么也不肯出声，可喘息声终究还是会漏出来"}
{"time": 1766454327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764206697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=all] ）"}
