{"time": 1766456227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349818473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=346344866]四周稍微有些凛冽的冷意，即便在这入秋的日子里也显得有些异常，你感觉...也许自己来对地方了。但是街道上并没有找到什么异常。"}
{"time": 1766456295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418055696", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该就是这里了....在地下吗？”"}
{"time": 1766456599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420859019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1977653027]\"怎么了?\"宿管走到你身边，低头扫了一眼你的额头和腿，\"弄得满头的汗啊...要去医院吗？\""}
{"time": 1766457297, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062532260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去过……没用”声音压得很低，梗着脖子摇头“忍忍就……”"}
{"time": 1766457532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1551574202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好困，睡一下)"}
