{"time": 1766488211, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045332834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(难道说，我其实是西幻天才)"}
{"time": 1766488313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188468360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能只要出场人物够多）"}
{"time": 1766488403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795390957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=692082769]\"我以为，已经是了诶?\"她的表情自然。学生证整体采用了烫金的工艺，表面采取了渐变的云母白，背面是你之前见过的学院徽章。一张上写着辛德瑞拉，另一张写着妃花。"}
