{"time": 1766491123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154038446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1020365401]“不然叫她起来重睡吗？宿管还被你弄走了，我都不知道房间在哪。”打个哈欠“……现在是多少年前？”"}
{"time": 1766491124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "489058166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=C5926D9BA596983FF38EB3F840CE0878.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhQEW-fXXkUDm_p2jVzPVh0WP25EKxjmpQMg_woo69Kcn9TTkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQkn1N3CwNPSJx8tLHcCkCP3oCwZKCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMFB1edml3yajS5njIxs66tV0Fq9n94I-aWjAihR_3iibLzaopNG0WNdWafBAFPyvWg,file_size=53990]"}
{"time": 1766491166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "282015129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我还在当学生会长的时候。\"她偏偏头看着你，\"怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1766491224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252226851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1412714187]纯白的戒指绽放出华彩，你感觉自己和那剑刃之间的联系变得更加紧密，几乎可以随心而动。"}
{"time": 1766491271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593401779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“诺亚，我来救你了....”利刃回手，去斩开蛛网"}
{"time": 1766491322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142746982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=282015129]“废话。”看着窗外“昨天晚上，我看见了大概是我姨妈的人”"}
{"time": 1766491338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075390337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=A99E9D2D01204F37C34256A0DD026046.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTuZlIIeC0XkdWc9LGV7D96fRnqxxiq6QEg_woo7az0hNXTkQMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQqR2OBoZBiNqOPOehSKx5_noCGoqCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMFB1edml3yajS5njIxs66tV0Fq9n94I-aWjAihR_3iibLzaopNG0WNdWafBAFPyvWg,file_size=29866]"}
{"time": 1766491747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681999261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=593401779]威力有所增幅，剑身周身也散发出朦胧的微光，可以顺带着冲破附近的蛛网"}
{"time": 1766491777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216382071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "但也仅限于此，抵及地表说的上有些无力。"}
{"time": 1766491790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "696728717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1142746982]\"你姨妈?\"她眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1766491854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273375483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“摩根家的基因真是强大。以及她说她的妹妹叫艾琳”"}
{"time": 1766491903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757698007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=273375483]\"哦，怎么了？\"她抬头，眨眨眼"}
{"time": 1766491994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166916457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“但是我没见过也没听过她，妈妈没和我讲过。”顿了顿“之后学院会发生什么？”"}
{"time": 1766492205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042001248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来我在）"}
{"time": 1766492208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869570593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（特异点）"}
{"time": 1766492700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53765124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1337846874]（我记得艾璃西亚双手都有啊，一共10枚）"}
{"time": 1766492762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "264828876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没，只有一只手)"}
{"time": 1766492798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "392846899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1166916457]\"也许只是重名吧。\"她耸耸肩"}
{"time": 1766492860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668462360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“肯定不是，哪有那么巧，而且看一眼就能知道是我家的人”把轮椅推近一点"}
{"time": 1766493075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891285701", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={4A760AB8-4653-7F7A-20C4-C0DB01FE822E}.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-4A760AB846537F7A20C4C0DB01FE822E/0,file_size=48132]"}
{"time": 1766493805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "372452363", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=668462360]她皱了皱眉，\"看我干什么?我像是知道吗？\""}
{"time": 1766493854, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1383606871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=668462360]她皱了皱眉，\"看我干什么?\"她从沙发上站起身，坐得离你远了点。"}
{"time": 1766494120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "514128820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“因为你肯定知道学院里接下来要发生什么，而且很重要。我不知道这里是什么情况，回到了过去？还是一场梦？不管是哪种，显然都不止于此，它一定会影响未来……或者说‘现在’”不依不饶地跟进“不然你的状态会比现在放松的多。你说你有不得不来玛纳利亚的事……这里才是你的目标，对么？你早就知道会有这些事态”"}
{"time": 1766495184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2091491468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"她稍微腾了腾身子，\"你说这些，是想?\"她的笑容有些意味深长，\"你想做些什么?\""}
{"time": 1766495491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811174735", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我想帮忙。”言简意赅，直视她的眼睛“不管你打算做什么我都帮。我觉得你还没疯到把玛纳利亚全扬了，至少不包括我和妃花，其他人我不在意。”"}
{"time": 1766495743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062276626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦?\"她的手抵在下巴上，\"也可以包括那个艾琳?\""}
{"time": 1766495785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1278350187", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么也在啊）"}
{"time": 1766495795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "956262142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我还以为只有姐姐来了（））"}
{"time": 1766496084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897288830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“等……妈妈也在？”一下子有些惊慌，但很快镇静下来“……那是我的事，我会想办法”"}
{"time": 1766496739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066765538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=897288830]\"那就不知道咯?\"她神秘地笑了笑，\"你说的，现在会影响现在，乃至未来。\"说完她站起身，\"昨天我也说了吧，趁现在，享受校园生活如何？\""}
{"time": 1766496926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2084334960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”眉头皱了半天，叹了口气，总算放弃了撬开她的嘴……但是可以撬开钱包“那给我钱”"}
{"time": 1766497298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "674050693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，你之前不是口气很大，要包养我一年吗？好妹妹。\"她作势要翻钱包"}
{"time": 1766498418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "568840868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(感觉我今天一直在睡)"}
{"time": 1766498431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1747921379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(正常，没睡和睡了差不多)"}
{"time": 1766498432, "type": "recv", "message_id": "894050903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（人之常情）"}
{"time": 1766498455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1756129573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=674050693]“之前在我家，现在在你家，能一样吗？”"}
{"time": 1766499627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1506217429", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1756129573]\"啧啧。\"银发的少女耸耸肩，\"用你们的学生证就可以了，餐费我已经登好了。\""}
{"time": 1766500228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "365690873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1216382071]（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
